I will implement the **SIFRA PROMODE** system update according to the "Premium Professional Blueprint," focusing on the high-contrast dark theme with neon blue and golden accents, granular identity support, and strict safety logic. I will also update the typing indicator in the standard chat to be more dynamic as requested.

### Updates Overview

1.  **`views/SifraProView.tsx`**: Complete rewrite to implement the **PROMODE Phase 1 Integration**.
    *   **Visuals:** Deep Navy/Black background, Neon Blue (`#3BB7FF`) accents, and Premium Gold (`#FFD700`) highlights.
    *   **Splash**: 3.0s entry with "Liquid Gold Shimmer" effect.
    *   **Identity Setup:** Comprehensive form for Gender (Trans/Non-binary support), Pronouns, and Salutations.
    *   **Dashboard:** 3-Layer Master Design with a Golden Halo profile, Neon Waveform, and pulsating "TalkTime" button.
    *   **Logic:** Injected strict System Prompts for the Gemini Live API to handle the 24-hour sensitive content rule and specific identity addressing.
2.  **`components/ChatMessage.tsx`**: Enhanced the typing indicator animation to be more dynamic and colorful.
3.  **`types.ts`**: Updated `ProSettings` to strictly match the new identity fields.

# Updated files:

## components/ChatMessage.tsx

Enhanced the typing indicator to use a gradient pulse and smoother animation for a more dynamic feel.

## types.ts

Updated `ProSettings` to include specific Identity, Pronouns, and Salutation fields required for the PROMODE system.

## views/SifraProView.tsx

Full implementation of the SIFRA PROMODE system with the "Premium Professional Blueprint" aesthetics and logic.

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from 'react';
import { UserProfile, ProSettings, ProModeId } from '../types';
import { motion, AnimatePresence } from 'framer-motion';
import { GoogleGenAI, LiveSession, LiveServerMessage, Modality, Blob } from '@google/genai';
import { encode, decode, decodeAudioData } from '../utils/audioUtils';

// Icons
import XMarkIcon from '../components/icons/XMarkIcon';
import MicrophoneIcon from '../components/icons/MicrophoneIcon';
import UserIcon from '../components/icons/UserIcon';
import BoltIcon from '../components/icons/BoltIcon';
import CheckCircleIcon from '../components/icons/CheckCircleIcon';
import SpeakerWaveIcon from '../components/icons/SpeakerWaveIcon';
import SparklesIcon from '../components/icons/SparklesIcon';
import ArrowLeftIcon from '../components/icons/ArrowLeftIcon';
import PhoneIcon from '../components/icons/PhoneIcon';

if (!process.env.API_KEY) {
    throw new Error("API_KEY environment variable is not set");
}

// --- THEME & STYLES ---
const THEME = {
    bg: '#05050A', // Deep Navy/Black
    primary: '#1A1A2E',
    secondary: '#B45CFF', // Neon Lavender
    accent: '#3BB7FF', // Electrified Neon Blue
    gold: '#FFD700', // Premium Gold
    surface: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)',
    border: 'rgba(59, 183, 255, 0.15)',
    goldBorder: 'rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3)',
};

const createBlob = (data: Float32Array): Blob => {
    const l = data.length;
    const int16 = new Int16Array(l);
    for (let i = 0; i < l; i++) {
        const s = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, data[i]));
        int16[i] = s * 32767;
    }
    return {
        data: encode(new Uint8Array(int16.buffer)),
        mimeType: 'audio/pcm;rate=16000',
    };
};

const safeCloseAudioContext = async (ctx: AudioContext | null) => {
    if (ctx && ctx.state !== 'closed') {
        try { await ctx.close(); } catch (e) { console.warn(e); }
    }
};

// --- DATA: MODES ---
const PRO_MODES = [
    { id: 'male.sir', name: 'Professional Sir', type: 'Male', desc: 'Respectful, Formal, Neutral', color: 'from-blue-600 to-cyan-500' },
    { id: 'male.buddy', name: 'Best Friend', type: 'Male', desc: 'Casual, Friendly, Brotherly', color: 'from-teal-500 to-emerald-500' },
    { id: 'male.street', name: 'Street Smart', type: 'Male', desc: 'Safe Street Style, Bold', color: 'from-indigo-600 to-violet-600' },
    { id: 'female.maam', name: 'Professional Mam', type: 'Female', desc: 'Polite, Caring, Formal', color: 'from-pink-500 to-rose-500' },
    { id: 'female.bestie', name: 'Soft Bestie', type: 'Female', desc: 'Sweet, Supportive, Close', color: 'from-fuchsia-500 to-purple-500' },
    { id: 'female.street', name: 'Bold Street', type: 'Female', desc: 'Playful, Energetic, Sharp', color: 'from-purple-600 to-indigo-600' }
];

// --- COMPONENT: SPLASH INTRO ---
const ProSplash: React.FC<{ onComplete: () => void }> = ({ onComplete }) => {
    useEffect(() => { setTimeout(onComplete, 3000); }, [onComplete]);

    return (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[#05050A] overflow-hidden">
            <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#1A1A2E] via-[#05050A] to-black opacity-80" />

            {/* Neon Aura Rings */}
            <motion.div 
                initial={{ scale: 0, opacity: 0 }}
                animate={{ scale: [0.8, 1.2, 1.5], opacity: [0, 0.4, 0] }}
                transition={{ duration: 3, ease: "easeOut", repeat: Infinity }}
                className="absolute w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full border border-[#3BB7FF]/30 shadow-[0_0_100px_rgba(59,183,255,0.2)]"
            />
            <motion.div 
                initial={{ scale: 0, opacity: 0 }}
                animate={{ scale: [0.5, 1, 1.2], opacity: [0, 0.3, 0] }}
                transition={{ duration: 3, delay: 0.5, ease: "easeOut", repeat: Infinity }}
                className="absolute w-[300px] h-[300px] rounded-full border border-[#FFD700]/20 shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(255,215,0,0.1)]"
            />

            {/* Logo & Text */}
            <motion.div 
                initial={{ scale: 0.8, opacity: 0 }}
                animate={{ scale: 1, opacity: 1 }}
                transition={{ duration: 1.5, ease: "backOut" }}
                className="relative z-10 text-center"
            >
                <div className="relative w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-6">
                    <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#FFD700] to-[#FFA500] rounded-full blur-xl opacity-40 animate-pulse"></div>
                    <div className="relative w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#333] to-black rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-[#FFD700] shadow-2xl">
                        <span className="text-4xl">💠</span>
                    </div>
                    {/* Liquid Gold Shimmer Effect Overlay */}
                    <motion.div 
                        className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent skew-x-12"
                        animate={{ x: [-100, 200] }}
                        transition={{ duration: 1.5, repeat: Infinity, repeatDelay: 1 }}
                    />
                </div>

                <h1 className="text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-[0.2em] drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_#3BB7FF]">
                    SIFRA <span className="text-[#3BB7FF]">PROMODE</span>
                </h1>

                <motion.p 
                    initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }}
                    animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
                    transition={{ delay: 1, duration: 1 }}
                    className="text-[10px] text-[#3BB7FF] uppercase tracking-widest mt-4 font-bold"
                >
                    Ultra-Personal AI Interaction System
                </motion.p>

                <p className="text-[9px] text-[#A0A0B0] mt-12 opacity-60">Powered by Google AI Studio + Sifra Hybrid Core</p>
            </motion.div>
        </div>
    );
};

// --- COMPONENT: USER IDENTITY SETUP ---
const ProSetup: React.FC<{ initialData: Partial<ProSettings>, onComplete: (data: Partial<ProSettings>) => void }> = ({ initialData, onComplete }) => {
    const [formData, setFormData] = useState({
        fullName: initialData.fullName || '',
        gender: initialData.gender || 'Male',
        pronouns: initialData.pronouns || 'he/him',
        addressingStyle: initialData.addressingStyle || 'Sir',
        communicationStyle: initialData.communicationStyle || 'Professional',
        voicePreference: initialData.voicePreference || 'Base Voice',
        language: initialData.language || 'English',
        purpose: initialData.purpose || []
    });

    const togglePurpose = (p: any) => {
        const current = formData.purpose || [];
        if (current.includes(p)) setFormData({ ...formData, purpose: current.filter(x => x !== p) });
        else setFormData({ ...formData, purpose: [...current, p] });
    };

    return (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-[#05050A] flex flex-col p-6 overflow-y-auto">
            <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Elevate Your Experience</h2>
            <p className="text-[#A0A0B0] text-sm mb-8">Tell Sifra who you are so I can serve you perfectly.</p>

            <div className="space-y-8 pb-24">
                {/* Name */}
                <div className="group">
                    <label className="text-[10px] text-[#FFD700] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Full Name</label>
                    <input 
                        value={formData.fullName}
                        onChange={e => setFormData({...formData, fullName: e.target.value})}
                        className="w-full bg-[#1A1A2E] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-white mt-2 focus:border-[#3BB7FF] focus:shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(59,183,255,0.2)] outline-none transition-all"
                        placeholder="Enter your name"
                    />
                </div>

                {/* Identity Grid */}
                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div>
                        <label className="text-[10px] text-[#3BB7FF] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Identity</label>
                        <div className="relative mt-2">
                            <select 
                                value={formData.gender}
                                onChange={e => setFormData({...formData, gender: e.target.value as any})}
                                className="w-full bg-[#1A1A2E] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-white outline-none appearance-none focus:border-[#3BB7FF]"
                            >
                                {['Male', 'Female', 'Trans Man', 'Trans Woman', 'Non-binary', 'Prefer not to say'].map(o => <option key={o} value={o}>{o}</option>)}
                            </select>
                            <div className="absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none text-[#3BB7FF]">▼</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label className="text-[10px] text-[#3BB7FF] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Pronouns</label>
                        <div className="relative mt-2">
                            <select 
                                value={formData.pronouns}
                                onChange={e => setFormData({...formData, pronouns: e.target.value as any})}
                                className="w-full bg-[#1A1A2E] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-white outline-none appearance-none focus:border-[#3BB7FF]"
                            >
                                {['he/him', 'she/her', 'they/them', 'Custom'].map(o => <option key={o} value={o}>{o}</option>)}
                            </select>
                            <div className="absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none text-[#3BB7FF]">▼</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                {/* Addressing */}
                <div>
                    <label className="text-[10px] text-[#FFD700] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Preferred Salutation</label>
                    <p className="text-[10px] text-[#A0A0B0] mb-2">How should Sifra address you?</p>
                    <div className="flex gap-3 mt-2">
                        {['Sir', 'Mam', 'Mx', 'Name Only'].map(s => (
                            <button 
                                key={s} 
                                onClick={() => setFormData({...formData, addressingStyle: s as any})}
                                className={`flex-1 p-3 rounded-xl border transition-all text-sm font-semibold ${formData.addressingStyle === s ? 'bg-[#3BB7FF]/10 border-[#3BB7FF] text-[#3BB7FF] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(59,183,255,0.1)]' : 'bg-[#1A1A2E] border-white/5 text-[#A0A0B0] hover:border-white/20'}`}
                            >
                                {s}
                            </button>
                        ))}
                    </div>
                </div>

                {/* Purpose */}
                <div>
                    <label className="text-[10px] text-[#3BB7FF] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Primary Purpose</label>
                    <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
                        {['Study', 'Personal Talk', 'Productivity', 'Emotional Support'].map(p => (
                            <button 
                                key={p} 
                                onClick={() => togglePurpose(p)}
                                className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border transition-all ${formData.purpose.includes(p as any) ? 'bg-[#3BB7FF] text-black border-[#3BB7FF]' : 'bg-transparent border-white/20 text-[#A0A0B0] hover:border-white/40'}`}
                            >
                                {p}
                            </button>
                        ))}
                    </div>
                </div>

                {/* Save Button */}
                <div className="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#05050A] to-transparent">
                    <button 
                        onClick={() => onComplete(formData)}
                        className="w-full py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFD700] to-[#FFA500] rounded-xl text-black font-black text-lg shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(255,215,0,0.3)] hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform active:scale-95"
                    >
                        Activate & Continue
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    );
};

// --- COMPONENT: PRO TALK SESSION (LIVE API) ---
const ProTalkSession: React.FC<{ 
    userProfile: UserProfile, 
    settings: ProSettings, 
    onClose: () => void,
    updateSafetyLog: () => void
}> = ({ userProfile, settings, onClose, updateSafetyLog }) => {
    const [status, setStatus] = useState('Initializing Secure Channel...');
    const [isSpeaking, setIsSpeaking] = useState(false);
    const canvasRef = useRef<HTMLCanvasElement>(null);
    const sessionRef = useRef<LiveSession | null>(null);
    const audioContextRef = useRef<AudioContext | null>(null);
    const analyserRef = useRef<AnalyserNode | null>(null);
    const volumeRef = useRef(0);

    const activeMode = PRO_MODES.find(m => m.id === settings.activeModeId) || PRO_MODES[0];

    useEffect(() => {
        let mounted = true;
        const start = async () => {
            try {
                const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true });
                if (!mounted) return;

                const ai = new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY as string });
                audioContextRef.current = new (window.AudioContext || (window as any).webkitAudioContext)({ sampleRate: 16000 });

                const ctx = audioContextRef.current;
                const source = ctx.createMediaStreamSource(stream);
                const processor = ctx.createScriptProcessor(4096, 1, 1);
                analyserRef.current = ctx.createAnalyser();

                source.connect(analyserRef.current);
                analyserRef.current.connect(processor);
                processor.connect(ctx.destination);

                processor.onaudioprocess = (e) => {
                    if (!sessionRef.current) return;
                    const inputData = e.inputBuffer.getChannelData(0);
                    sessionRef.current.sendRealtimeInput({ media: createBlob(inputData) });
                };

                // SAFETY & SYSTEM PROMPT (Strict Identity & 24h Rule)
                const systemPrompt = `
                    You are SIFRA PRO, currently in '${activeMode.name}' mode.

                    USER IDENTITY (MANDATORY):
                    - Name: ${settings.fullName || userProfile.name}
                    - Identity: ${settings.gender}
                    - Pronouns: ${settings.pronouns}
                    - Salutation Priority: Address user as "${settings.addressingStyle === 'Name Only' ? settings.fullName : settings.addressingStyle}".
                    - NEVER infer gender; always use the stored identity.

                    MODE BEHAVIOR (${activeMode.name}):
                    - Description: ${activeMode.desc}.
                    - Tone: Maintain this persona strictly.

                    SAFETY PROTOCOLS (STRICT ENFORCEMENT):
                    1. ILLEGAL/DANGEROUS: Refuse immediately.
                    2. SEXUALLY EXPLICIT: 
                       - Allowed ONCE per 24 hours (educational/safe context only).
                       - If user asks again within 24 hours (check context), REPLY: "Sorry, I cannot discuss this topic in detail again today. Please let me know if I can help you with something else." and change subject.
                       - Current Time: ${new Date().toISOString()}.
                       - Last Sensitive Answer: ${settings.sensitiveAnswerLastAt || 'None'}.

                    TRIGGER WORDS (AUTO-LEARNING):
                    - "Sifra faster": Increase speaking rate +20%.
                    - "Sifra calm": Soften tone immediately.
                    - "Talk clean": If in Street mode, switch to formal.
                `;

                const session = await ai.live.connect({
                    model: 'gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-09-2025',
                    callbacks: {
                        onopen: () => { if(mounted) setStatus('PROMODE ONLINE'); },
                        onmessage: (msg: LiveServerMessage) => {
                            if(!mounted) return;
                            const audio = msg.serverContent?.modelTurn?.parts?.[0]?.inlineData?.data;
                            if (audio) {
                                setIsSpeaking(true);
                                const outCtx = new (window.AudioContext || (window as any).webkitAudioContext)();
                                decodeAudioData(decode(audio), outCtx, 24000, 1).then(buffer => {
                                    const src = outCtx.createBufferSource();
                                    src.buffer = buffer;
                                    src.connect(outCtx.destination);
                                    src.start();
                                    src.onended = () => setIsSpeaking(false);
                                });
                            }
                        },
                        onclose: () => { if(mounted) onClose(); }
                    },
                    config: {
                        responseModalities: [Modality.AUDIO],
                        speechConfig: { voiceConfig: { prebuiltVoiceConfig: { voiceName: 'Kore' } } },
                        systemInstruction: systemPrompt
                    }
                });
                sessionRef.current = session;

            } catch (e) {
                console.error(e);
                setStatus('Connection Failed');
            }
        };
        start();
        return () => { 
            mounted = false; 
            sessionRef.current?.close();
            safeCloseAudioContext(audioContextRef.current);
        };
    }, []);

    // Neon Waveform Visualizer
    useEffect(() => {
        const canvas = canvasRef.current;
        if (!canvas) return;
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
        if (!ctx) return;
        canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
        canvas.height = 300;

        const render = () => {
            if (!analyserRef.current) return requestAnimationFrame(render);
            const data = new Uint8Array(analyserRef.current.frequencyBinCount);
            analyserRef.current.getByteTimeDomainData(data);

            let sum = 0;
            for(let i=0; i<data.length; i++) sum += Math.abs((data[i] - 128) / 128);
            volumeRef.current += (sum/data.length - volumeRef.current) * 0.25; // Smoother alpha

            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
            ctx.lineWidth = 4;

            // Neon Glow Effect
            ctx.shadowBlur = 15;
            ctx.shadowColor = isSpeaking ? '#FFD700' : '#3BB7FF';
            ctx.strokeStyle = isSpeaking ? '#FFD700' : '#3BB7FF';

            ctx.beginPath();

            const sliceWidth = canvas.width * 1.0 / data.length;
            let x = 0;
            for(let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {
                const v = (data[i] / 128.0); 
                const y = (v * canvas.height/2) + (isSpeaking ? 0 : Math.sin(x * 0.05 + Date.now() * 0.005) * 10); // Idle float

                // Amplify visualization
                const amp = 1 + volumeRef.current * 8;
                const finalY = (y - canvas.height/2) * amp + canvas.height/2;

                if(i===0) ctx.moveTo(x, finalY); else ctx.lineTo(x, finalY);
                x += sliceWidth;
            }
            ctx.stroke();
            requestAnimationFrame(render);
        };
        render();
    }, [isSpeaking]);

    return (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-[#05050A] flex flex-col">
            {/* Header */}
            <div className="p-6 flex justify-between items-center bg-[#05050A]/90 backdrop-blur border-b border-[#3BB7FF]/10">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div className={`w-3 h-3 rounded-full animate-pulse ${isSpeaking ? 'bg-[#FFD700]' : 'bg-[#3BB7FF]'}`} />
                    <span className="text-white font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">{status}</span>
                </div>
                <button onClick={onClose} className="p-3 bg-red-500/20 rounded-full text-white border border-red-500/30 hover:bg-red-500/40"><XMarkIcon /></button>
            </div>

            {/* Visualizer Area */}
            <div className="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative">
                <div className="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none opacity-20">
                    <div className={`w-80 h-80 rounded-full blur-[120px] ${isSpeaking ? 'bg-[#FFD700]' : 'bg-[#3BB7FF]'}`} />
                </div>
                <canvas ref={canvasRef} className="w-full h-[300px]" />

                <div className="mt-8 text-center">
                    <h2 className="text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-widest drop-shadow-lg">{isSpeaking ? 'SIFRA SPEAKING' : 'LISTENING'}</h2>
                    <p className="text-[#3BB7FF] text-xs mt-3 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold">Active Mode: {activeMode.name}</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            {/* Controls */}
            <div className="p-10 pb-16 flex justify-center gap-8">
                <button className="p-6 rounded-full bg-[#1A1A2E] border border-[#3BB7FF]/30 text-white shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,183,255,0.1)] hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><MicrophoneIcon className="w-8 h-8" /></button>
                <button className={`p-6 rounded-full border text-white shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,215,0,0.2)] hover:scale-110 transition-transform ${isSpeaking ? 'bg-[#FFD700] text-black border-[#FFD700]' : 'bg-[#1A1A2E] border-[#FFD700]/30'}`}><SpeakerWaveIcon className="w-8 h-8" /></button>
            </div>
        </div>
    );
};

// --- MAIN VIEW ---
const SifraProView: React.FC<{ userProfile: UserProfile, onUpdateProfile: (p: UserProfile) => void, onClose: () => void }> = ({ userProfile, onUpdateProfile, onClose }) => {
    const [view, setView] = useState<'splash' | 'setup' | 'welcome' | 'dashboard'>('splash');
    const [showTalk, setShowTalk] = useState(false);
    const [showSelector, setShowSelector] = useState(false);

    // Initial check
    useEffect(() => {
        if (userProfile.sifraProSettings?.isEnabled) {
            setView('dashboard'); 
        }
    }, []);

    const handleSetupComplete = (data: Partial<ProSettings>) => {
        const newSettings: ProSettings = {
            isEnabled: true,
            fullName: data.fullName!,
            gender: data.gender as any,
            pronouns: data.pronouns as any,
            addressingStyle: data.addressingStyle as any,
            communicationStyle: data.communicationStyle as any || 'Professional',
            purpose: data.purpose as any || [],
            voicePreference: 'Base Voice',
            language: 'English',
            activeModeId: data.gender === 'Female' ? 'female.maam' : 'male.sir',
            voicePitch: 1,
            voiceSpeed: 1,
            noiseSuppression: 'on',
            sensitiveAnswerLastAt: null
        };
        onUpdateProfile({ ...userProfile, sifraProSettings: newSettings });
        setView('welcome');
    };

    if (view === 'splash') return <ProSplash onComplete={() => setView('setup')} />;

    if (view === 'setup') return <ProSetup initialData={userProfile.sifraProSettings || {}} onComplete={handleSetupComplete} />;

    if (view === 'welcome') {
        setTimeout(() => setView('dashboard'), 3500);
        const settings = userProfile.sifraProSettings!;
        return (
            <div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-[#05050A] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center overflow-hidden">
                <motion.div initial={{ scale: 0 }} animate={{ scale: [0, 1.2, 1] }} transition={{ duration: 1 }}>
                    <h1 className="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-2 tracking-tight">
                        Welcome back, <br/>
                        <span className="text-[#FFD700] drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,215,0,0.5)]">
                            {settings.addressingStyle === 'Name Only' ? settings.fullName : `${settings.addressingStyle} ${settings.fullName?.split(' ')[0]}`}
                        </span>
                    </h1>
                </motion.div>

                {/* Particle Burst Effect (Simulated with CSS/Motion) */}
                <div className="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
                    {[...Array(20)].map((_, i) => (
                        <motion.div
                            key={i}
                            className="absolute w-2 h-2 bg-[#3BB7FF] rounded-full"
                            initial={{ x: window.innerWidth/2, y: window.innerHeight/2, opacity: 1 }}
                            animate={{ 
                                x: window.innerWidth/2 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 500,
                                y: window.innerHeight/2 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 500,
                                opacity: 0
                            }}
                            transition={{ duration: 1.5, ease: "easeOut" }}
                        />
                    ))}
                </div>

                <motion.p 
                    initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }} 
                    animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }} 
                    transition={{ delay: 1 }}
                    className="text-[#A0A0B0] mt-6 tracking-widest uppercase text-xs"
                >
                    Your personalized Sifra PROMODE is now fully optimized.
                </motion.p>
            </div>
        );
    }

