This error happens because `sifraProSettings` might be undefined when the view is in 'dashboard' mode (due to race conditions or initial state latency), leading to `settings.activeModeId` throwing an error.

I will update `views/SifraProView.tsx` to handle this case by showing a loading state if `settings` are missing, even if the view state suggests it should be ready.

